# World looks: the same view of six biomes at noon and at sunset, looking slightly down.
# For Tester 2 (Researcher's round 7). Replace each SPOT line's coordinates with a spot you
# found in that biome (F3 or /air shows the biome): open ground with trees 20-60 blocks ahead.
# Fresh world (a new name), creative so nothing interrupts; HUD hidden if the build allows (F1).
loaded
chat /gamemode creative
chat /weather clear
# --- plains ---
chat /gamemode creative
chat /tp -450 200 535
wait 8
loaded
where spot
idle
look 45 -12
chat /time set 6000
wait 3
shot plains_noon.png
chat /time set 11900
wait 3
shot plains_sunset.png
